  <!-- Burning Fury -->
  <!--原中文: '狂怒', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Burning Fury',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Burning Fury-->
  <TM_BurningFury.label>狂怒</TM_BurningFury.label>
  <!--原中文: '激活或停用持续性战技：狂怒\n狂怒会对周围的敌人造成周期性的伤害，除此之外他还会灼烧流血的伤口，并对施法者进行强化\n狂怒：\n移动能力 +10%\n呼吸能力 +40%\n血液循环 +40%\n疼痛阈值 +40%\n抗热能力 +100%\n当狂怒开启时，施法者将不受控制并减伤 35%.\n此技能会主动消耗体力，当施法者的体力达到0时会自动取消。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Activates or deactivates the sustained combat skill Burning Fury.
	
Burning Fury causes periodic burning damage to nearby enemies as well as the caster. It also cauterizes bleeding wounds and applies a combat enhancement on the caster.

Burning Fury:
Movement +10%
Breathing +40%
Blood pumping +40%
Pain threshold +40%
Armor (Heat) +100%

While active, the caster cannot be staggered and will reduce all incoming damage by 35%.

This ability actively consumes stamina, and will automatically cancel once the caster's stamina reaches 0.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Activates or deactivates the sustained combat skill Burning Fury.
	
Burning Fury causes periodic burning damage to nearby enemies as well as the caster. It also cauterizes bleeding wounds and applies a combat enhancement on the caster.

Burning Fury:
Movement +10%
Breathing +40%
Blood pumping +40%
Pain threshold +40%
Armor (Heat) +100%

While active, the caster cannot be staggered and will reduce all incoming damage by 35%.

This ability actively consumes stamina, and will automatically cancel once the caster's stamina reaches 0.-->
  <TM_BurningFury.description>激活或停用持续性战技：狂怒\n狂怒会对周围的敌人造成周期性的伤害，除此之外他还会灼烧流血的伤口，并对施法者进行强化\n狂怒：\n移动能力 +10%\n呼吸能力 +40%\n血液循环 +40%\n疼痛阈值 +40%\n抗热能力 +100%\n当狂怒开启时，施法者将不受控制并减伤 35%.\n此技能会主动消耗体力，当施法者的体力达到0时会自动取消。</TM_BurningFury.description>
